{
  "uid": "meterhub-logs",
  "title": "MeterHub Logs",
  "tags": [
    "meterhub"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "meterhub-loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "service",
          "stream": "",
          "type": 1
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to search",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Find one request across all services** \u2014 paste an ID from a log line, a Jaeger trace, or an API error response:\n\n```logql\n{service=~\".+\"} |= \"<traceId>\"\n```\n\n- `traceId` joins to the same request in the [Jaeger UI](http://localhost:16686) (distributed tracing, spec 2).\n- `requestId` is the `X-Correlation-ID` returned by the API (conventions \u00a79).\n- IDs are **line filters**, not labels \u2014 never label by them (cardinality, spec 3 \u00a76).\n- Extract fields at query time: `{service=\"meter-service\"} | json | level=\"ERROR\"`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "All logs (filtered by Service variable)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "meterhub-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=~\"$service\"}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "meterhub-loki"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    }
  ]
}